cuems-videocomposer (0.1.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * cuems-videoindexer: default to HardwareDecodePreference::AUTO so the
    standalone CLI matches the inline VC path (~8x faster end-to-end on
    long-GOP H.264; Pass 2 short-circuits on VAAPI hosts and uses the
    existing timestamp fallback for frame_pts). ClickUp 869dbywj2.
  * Packaging: drop stale install(contrib/cuems-generate-display-conf)
    rule from CMakeLists.txt. The script was removed when videocomposer
    took over display.conf generate+load; the orphan install rule made
    cmake --install (and therefore dh_auto_install) abort before the
    full bin/ tree was written, so the .deb was missing files.

