cuems-videocomposer (0.1.1-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix DRM page flip buffer management on Intel integrated graphics
    - Use SetCrtc warmup period after modeset before attempting page flips
    - Auto-fallback to SetCrtc-only mode if page flips consistently fail
    - Fix buffer leak in SetCrtc fallback path
    - Properly release GBM buffers to prevent "No space left on device" errors
    - Improves stability on Intel N100 and similar low-power GPUs
  * Update build dependencies in debian/control
    - Add missing libxpm-dev, libxv-dev, libimlib2-dev dependencies

